		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Long-armed, cloven-hooved fiend with a sea anemone head. In the center is a single square-pupiled green eye.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 20, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +5 (1d8 + consume humanity), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Consume Humanity</strong>. CON 12+ or 1d4 CHA damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by cold iron or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapechange</strong>. Assume the form of the last creature the utukku has caused CHA damage to.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
